payload.description:
Rework item pages to the Signal artboard (https://claude.ai/artifact/EoXGtpzsayij4d7tmrfZ9r):
- the status word, with who stamped it and when;
- summary and primary evidence;
- On the map: entities and relations;
- ratings on the four dimensions, readers and editors shown separately, with "too few" under 5 ratings;
- the Underrated mark;
- the stories it appears in;
- nearby on the map.

Remove "#1 this week" framing.

Acceptance: every one of the 70 items renders the new layout, and the Markdown versions carry the same content.
